{
 "title": "机器人关节的力矩",
 "title_en": "Torque at a robot joint",
 "audio": "配音.wav",
 "duration": 121.57,
 "segments": [
  {
   "t0": 0.8,
   "t1": 5.53,
   "zh": "一台机器人手臂，要把一个两公斤的零件水平举起来。",
   "en": "A robot arm has to hold a 2 kg part out horizontally."
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.98,
   "t1": 10.33,
   "zh": "问题来了：肩关节的电机，至少要多大的劲？",
   "en": "How strong must the shoulder motor be?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 10.78,
   "t1": 14.26,
   "zh": "先想一个生活里的例子：用扳手拧螺母。",
   "en": "First, an everyday example: turning a nut with a spanner."
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.71,
   "t1": 17.62,
   "zh": "手握得越靠外，拧起来越省力。",
   "en": "The further out you hold it, the easier it turns."
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.07,
   "t1": 23.71,
   "zh": "这说明，转动的效果不只看力有多大，还看力离转轴有多远。",
   "en": "Turning depends on the force and on how far it is from the axis."
  },
  {
   "t0": 24.16,
   "t1": 27.77,
   "zh": "这个转动的效果，就叫力矩，英文是 torque。",
   "en": "This turning effect is called torque."
  },
  {
   "t0": 28.22,
   "t1": 32.04,
   "zh": "力矩等于力乘以力臂：τ 等于 F 乘以 r。",
   "en": "Torque equals force times lever arm: tau = F times r."
  },
  {
   "t0": 32.49,
   "t1": 36.08,
   "zh": "力臂，是转轴到力的作用线的垂直距离。",
   "en": "The lever arm is the perpendicular distance from the axis to the line of the force."
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.53,
   "t1": 38.26,
   "zh": "力矩的单位是牛·米。",
   "en": "Torque is measured in newton-metres."
  },
  {
   "t0": 38.71,
   "t1": 43.58,
   "zh": "现在回到机器人手臂，先把它画成一个简单的模型。",
   "en": "Back to the robot arm: first, a simple model."
  },
  {
   "t0": 44.03,
   "t1": 49.08,
   "zh": "肩关节是转轴，手臂长零点五米，零件挂在末端。",
   "en": "The shoulder is the axis, the arm is 0.5 m long, the part hangs at the end."
  },
  {
   "t0": 49.53,
   "t1": 55.72,
   "zh": "零件的重力，F 等于 m g，两公斤乘以九点八，约十九点六牛。",
   "en": "The part's weight: F = mg = 2 × 9.8 ≈ 19.6 N."
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.17,
   "t1": 61.14,
   "zh": "手臂水平时，力臂就是整条手臂的长度，零点五米。",
   "en": "With the arm level, the lever arm is the whole arm, 0.5 m."
  },
  {
   "t0": 61.59,
   "t1": 65.24,
   "zh": "所以零件产生的力矩，约是九点八牛·米。",
   "en": "So the part makes about 9.8 N·m of torque."
  },
  {
   "t0": 65.69,
   "t1": 70.24,
   "zh": "手臂自己也有重量，一点二公斤，重心在中点。",
   "en": "The arm itself weighs 1.2 kg, centred at its middle."
  },
  {
   "t0": 70.69,
   "t1": 75.26,
   "zh": "它的力矩是一点二乘九点八乘零点二五，约二点九牛·米。",
   "en": "Its torque: 1.2 × 9.8 × 0.25 ≈ 2.9 N·m."
  },
  {
   "t0": 75.71,
   "t1": 80.07,
   "zh": "加起来，电机至少要提供约十二点七牛·米。",
   "en": "Together the motor must give at least about 12.7 N·m."
  },
  {
   "t0": 80.52,
   "t1": 84.88,
   "zh": "实际选电机时还要留余量，常取一点五到两倍。",
   "en": "In practice we leave a margin of 1.5 to 2 times."
  },
  {
   "t0": 85.33,
   "t1": 89.46,
   "zh": "所以我们选一台能输出二十五牛·米的关节电机。",
   "en": "So we choose a joint motor rated at 25 N·m."
  },
  {
   "t0": 89.91,
   "t1": 94.44,
   "zh": "再想一下：手臂抬起六十度时，力臂变短了。",
   "en": "Now lift the arm to 60 degrees: the lever arm gets shorter."
  },
  {
   "t0": 94.89,
   "t1": 99.4,
   "zh": "力臂变成 r 乘 cos60°，力矩只剩一半。",
   "en": "It becomes r cos 60°, so the torque halves."
  },
  {
   "t0": 99.85,
   "t1": 103.58,
   "zh": "所以手臂水平伸直的时候，关节最吃力。",
   "en": "So the joint works hardest with the arm level."
  },
  {
   "t0": 104.03,
   "t1": 106.61,
   "zh": "小结：力矩等于力乘以力臂。",
   "en": "Summary: torque equals force times lever arm."
  },
  {
   "t0": 107.06,
   "t1": 112.42,
   "zh": "设计机器人关节，要按最吃力的姿势来算，再留出余量。",
   "en": "Size a robot joint for its hardest pose, then add a margin."
  },
  {
   "t0": 112.87,
   "t1": 119.62,
   "zh": "最后，打开虚拟实验二点五，自己调一调肩关节的姿态，看看力矩怎么变。",
   "en": "Finally, open virtual lab 2.5, change the shoulder pose yourself and watch the torque change."
  }
 ],
